### API Requests Examples for RBAC System
### Use this file with REST Client extension in VS Code

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### ========================================
### 1. Create Super Admin Role
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "super_admin",
  "permission": [
    {
      "campaign": {
        "add": true,
        "view": true,
        "edit": true,
        "delete": true
      },
      "properties": {
        "add": true,
        "view": true,
        "edit": true,
        "delete": true
      }
    }
  ]
}

### ========================================
### 2. Create User Role
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "user",
  "permission": [
    {
      "campaign": {
        "add": false,
        "view": true,
        "edit": true,
        "delete": true
      },
      "properties": {
        "add": true,
        "view": true,
        "edit": false,
        "delete": false
      }
    }
  ]
}

### ========================================
### 3. Get All Roles
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/rbac/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 4. Get Role by ID
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/rbac/roles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 5. Update Role
### ========================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/rbac/roles/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "permission": [
    {
      "campaign": {
        "add": true,
        "view": true,
        "edit": true,
        "delete": false
      },
      "properties": {
        "add": true,
        "view": true,
        "edit": true,
        "delete": false
      }
    }
  ]
}

### ========================================
### 6. Delete Role
### ========================================
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/rbac/roles/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 7. Get My Permissions
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/rbac/my-permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 8. Test Property Creation (requires 'add' permission)
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/properties
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listing_date": "2025-01-01",
  "listing_price": 450000,
  "street_address": "123 Main St",
  "city": "New York",
  "state": "NY",
  "zip_code": "10001"
}

### ========================================
### 9. Test Property View (requires 'view' permission)
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 10. Test Property Update (requires 'edit' permission)
### ========================================
PUT {{baseUrl}}/properties/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listing_price": 460000
}

### ========================================
### 11. Test Property Delete (requires 'delete' permission)
### ========================================
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/properties/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 12. Login as User (get JWT token)
### ========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ========================================
### Expected Results:
### ========================================
###
### For USER role (limited permissions):
### - POST /properties -> ✅ SUCCESS (has 'add' permission)
### - GET /properties/:id -> ✅ SUCCESS (has 'view' permission)
### - PUT /properties/:id -> ❌ FORBIDDEN (no 'edit' permission)
### - DELETE /properties/:id -> ❌ FORBIDDEN (no 'delete' permission)
###
### For SUPER_ADMIN role (full permissions):
### - ALL endpoints -> ✅ SUCCESS
###
### ========================================
